    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34961" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναπο-τίθεμαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lay aside</i> or <i>store up in</i>, <i><span class="en">
